2Ki 9:1 , Elisha sends a young prophet with instructions to anoint Jehu at Ramoth-gilead;
2Ki 9:4 , The prophet having done his message, flees;
2Ki 9:11 , Jehu, being made king by the soldiers, kills Joram in the field of Naboth;
2Ki 9:27 , Ahaziah is slain at Gur, and buried at Jerusalem;
2Ki 9:30 , Proud Jezebel is thrown down out of a window, and eaten by dogs.
